{"id":350,"name":"milotic","speciesId":350,"dex":350,"form":"normal","generation":3,"types":["water"],"stats":{"hp":95,"attack":60,"defense":79,"special-attack":100,"special-defense":125,"speed":81},"abilities":[{"name":"marvel-scale","hidden":false},{"name":"competitive","hidden":false},{"name":"cute-charm","hidden":true}],"height":62,"weight":1620,"baseExp":189,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/350.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/350.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/350.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/350.ogg","genus":"Tender Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon gentil","flavor":[{"version":"black","text":"Its lovely scales are described as rainbow colored. They change color depending on the viewing angle."},{"version":"ruby","text":"MILOTIC is said to be the most beautiful of all the POKéMON. It has the power to becalm such emotions as anger and hostility to quell bitter feuding."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"MILOTIC live at the bottom of large lakes. When this POKéMON’s body glows a vivid pink, it releases a pulsing wave of energy that brings soothing calm to restless spirits."},{"version":"emerald","text":"It is said to live at the bottom of large lakes. Considered to be the most beautiful of all POKéMON, it has been depicted in paintings and statues."},{"version":"firered","text":"MILOTIC is breathtakingly beautiful. Those that see it are said to forget their combative spirits."},{"version":"diamond","text":"When people bicker, it is said to arise from the depths of lakes to becalm violent hearts."},{"version":"pearl","text":"It is the world’s most beautiful Pokémon. There are many works of art featuring MILOTIC."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It’s said that a glimpse of a MILOTIC and its beauty will calm any hostile emotions you’re feeling."},{"version":"x","text":"Milotic is breathtakingly beautiful. Those that see it are said to forget their combative spirits."},{"version":"y","text":"It is the world’s most beautiful Pokémon. There are many works of art featuring Milotic."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Milotic is said to be the most beautiful of all the Pokémon. It has the power to becalm such emotions as anger and hostility to quell bitter feuding."},{"version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Milotic live at the bottom of large lakes. When this Pokémon’s body glows a vivid pink, it releases a pulsing wave of energy that brings soothing calm to troubled hearts."},{"version":"sun","text":"Milotic has provided inspiration to many artists. It has even been referred to as the most beautiful Pokémon of all."},{"version":"moon","text":"It lives at the bottom of clear lakes. In times of war, it shows itself, which soothes people’s minds and hearts."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"While Milotic is said to be the most beautiful Pokémon, Trainers who like Feebas and have raised it are seemingly disappointed by Milotic."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its dwelling place is the bottom of big lakes. Those who behold its loveliness are said to have their hearts purified."},{"version":"shield","text":"It’s said that a glimpse of a Milotic and its beauty will calm any hostile emotions you’re feeling."}],"flavorPt":"Dizem que vislumbrar um Milotic e sua beleza acalmará qualquer emoção hostil que você esteja sentindo.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":60,"eggGroups":["water1","dragon"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"feebas","speciesId":349,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Beleza alta","Troca, Segurando Prism Scale"],"species":"milotic","speciesId":350,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":350,"name":"milotic","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/350.png"}],"games":[